COUNT FINDING: BELOW TARGET on BTCUSD, ETHUSDT, SOLUSDT

Per the intake, GAP_K is NOT lowered and no grid is run. A
symbol below the target cannot support a POSITIVE claim for
this family, and a threshold moved to reach a count would be a
parameter fitted to an observed shortfall.
